<title>USA: Zions Bancorp unit issues securities.</title>
<headline>Zions Bancorp unit issues securities.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bancorp said on Friday that its subsidiary, Zions Institutional Capital Trust A, issued $200 million of 8.536 percent trust preferred securities in a private sale.</p>
<p>The securities pay interest semiannually and mature on December 15, 2026. The company said it would use the proceeds from the sale to acquire junior subordinated debentures of the bank which will use the funds for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
